  "description": "Escaping the thought of ketchup as a singular tomato-based sauce led to this blueberry ketchup. It has the familiar sweet and tangy flavor but with a bright fruitiness that opens the door to a wide variety of uses. \"Blueberry ketchup?!\" you say. (We can hear you.) Try it as a dip for sweet potato fries or spread on some grilled pork chops.",
